 "limitations": [
  "one packet, HALF only, Linux gcc Release, one machine",
  "the injection hook consumes a queue entry exactly as production does and then skips the reconstruction: failure injection, not a fix",
  "natural control calls and induced calls reach identical byte states, so a digest match is corroboration only; the witness is claimed>executed",
  "the probe does not show how often production reaches this state unaided",
  "no FULL arm, no Windows replay, no other format",
  "skipped counts are per call and depend on how many times the guarded hook matched, so they are descriptive, not a rate"
